      "id": "klein-s09-greeting-01",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "title": null,
      "text": "你好。我是克莱恩·莫雷蒂。若你愿意，我们可以先从一件最容易验证的小事开始。",
      "sourceKind": "original",
      "evidenceRefs": [],
      "gap": null,
